    "description": "Title:\nHemingray Glass Insulator Pair Clear Utility Home Decor Collectible\nBrand:\nHemingray\nDepartment:\nAdults\nCondition:\nUsed\nCondition Description:\nUsed - shows signs of age and wear\nStyle:\nUtility\nColor:\nClear\nCategory:\nCollectibles & Art\nType:\nInsulator\nCare Instructions:\nHand Wash Only\nCountry Of Origin:\nUnited States\nDesign:\nFunctional\nFeatures:\nVintage\nGlassware Type:\nOther Glassware\nMaterial:\nGlass\nNumber Of Items In Set:\n2\nSet Includes:\n2 insulators\nShape:\nRound\nTheme:\nIndustrial\nUnit Quantity:\n2\nUnit Type:\nUnit\nDescription:\nAdd a touch of industrial charm to your collection with this pair of vintage clear glass insulators. These sturdy pieces, formerly used on power or telegraph lines, feature thick, quality glass construction with a utilitarian round design. The Hemingray brand signature is visible, showcasing American-made craftsmanship that collectors appreciate. Both insulators display slightly different designs and details, including bases one is smooth, while the other has pronounced dimples. Aged patina and minor marks highlight their authentic history and prior field use, offering unique character to each item. These insulators are perfect for display in home decor as conversation pieces or for creative upcycling projects. Their robust glass structure and timeless look make them suitable for collectors, decorators, or anyone interested in industrial relics. Please note: Both items show visible wear and surface residue consistent with age and use. No major cracks or chips are evident from inspection. Enjoy these pieces as decorative accents or add them to your vintage glassware collection",
